exports[`getOneCourseProof, fed the course templates own examples given: [case2] a course whose yields the reader must refuse when: [t9] the assess is below the bar then: a failed transfer refuses, and names the phase to return to: test-proof-transfer-failed 1`] = `
"✋ ConstraintError: the assess is below the bar
   ├─ at = $REPO/.route/pursuit/2.courses.pursue.yield/course=1.idempotency/5.1.outcome.assess.yield.md
   ├─ score = 3/3
   ├─ transfer = failed
   └─ fix: return to the weakest phase (2.2 for a gap in the canon, 3 for an untested claim, 4.1 for a brief the role did not reach for): rhx route.stone.set --stone <phase> --as rewound, then drive back through and assess again"
`;

