exports[`getOneCourseProof, fed the course templates own examples given: [case3] a native role with no boot spec, and two briefs it held before the course when: [t2] the student writes a simple spec with the new brief at say then: it refuses: the extant briefs move from say to ref, as the snapshot shows 1`] = `
"✋ ConstraintError: the boot spec moves briefs the role booted before the course
   ├─ boot path = .agent/repo=.this/role=mechanic/boot.yml
   ├─ briefs moved
   │  ├─ briefs/rule.require.a.md (say → ref)
   │  └─ briefs/rule.require.b.md (say → ref)
   └─ fix: boot each as it booted before: in a simple spec, drop the \`say\` key and name new briefs under \`briefs.ref\`; in a subject spec, name each moved brief where it was. then re-run"
`;
